st overall.\n\nMaybe candidate A's anticipation and leadership are valuable for long-distance, but not open to new ideas could affect adaptability. Show-off may affect crew but maybe manageable.\n\nGiven limited info, I think candidate B is strongest overall: reliability (conscientious), stress resilience, technical (weather, computer), despite memory issue and nasty remarks. Memory for numbers could be mitigated with checklists. Nasty remarks are concerning but maybe can be coached.\n\nAlternatively candidate C has strong decision and calm, but communication issues may be fatal.\n\nThus I will recommend Candidate B.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE: state recommendation, refer to no prior discussion (maybe say \"Since we are starting...\"), give evidence: conscientious, handles stress, good weather assessment, but note concerns: nasty remarks, weak memory. Argue that strengths outweigh concerns.\n\nMETADATA_JSON vote B."}
